         fhir:display [ fhir:v "PractitionerRole.period" ] ;
         fhir:equivalence [ fhir:v "equivalent" ] ;
         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `PractitionerRole.period` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `PractitionerRole.period` as `Equivalent`.\nIf a practitioner is performing a role within an organization over multiple, non-adjacent periods, there should be a distinct PractitionerRole instance for each period.  For example, if a nurse is employed at a hospital, leaves the organization for a period of time due to pandemic related stress, but returns post-pandemic to the same job role, there would be two PractitionerRole instances for the different periods of employment." ]
